# led_tennis in the emulator's window (ECP5_GUI_SCRIPT; see gui/src/trace.rs).
# Attract mode plays both sides; FIRE1 then starts a game: the left player
# (FIRE1, under D7) against the computer on the right. The script cannot
# see the ball, so its hits land at random: some return the ball, some are
# faults. Buttons are held for a second, past the 10 ms debounce at the
# window's speed.
0 rate max
0 run
1 board 3d
20 button 1 down   # FIRE1: start a human game
21 button 1 up
26 button 1 down   # swings at the ball
27 button 1 up
32 button 1 down
33 button 1 up
38 button 1 down
39 button 1 up
44 button 1 down
45 button 1 up
55 quit
